GrapesJS core integration

Upstream: https://github.com/GrapesJS/grapesjs
Installed npm release: grapesjs 0.23.8
License: BSD-3-Clause; the unmodified license is included in LICENSE.

Academy uses the actual open-source core as a lazily loaded visual HTML/CSS
editor. It does not use GrapesJS Studio SDK, cloud storage or a paid AI service.
The wrapper and Bulgarian controls are Academy integration code.
Generated public sites do not require the editor runtime.
